codex
One bigger alternative is to hand off the final layernorm-plus-linear to cuDNN/cuBLAS after making the hidden dimension contiguous. It adds a transpose copy, but could replace the custom strided final kernel with faster dense primitives. I’m benchmarking that tradeoff locally before touching the submission.
