codex
The old/new gate paths match for B=2 as well. One robustness gap remains: my no-out-gate post path would break any hidden non-128 dimension outside `{384,768}` because the fallback final path still expects `out_gate`. I’m guarding the optimization to dim 384/768 only and retesting.
